    "1. More diverse data sources\n",
    "2. Better data cleaning and preprocessing\n",
    "3. A much larger dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "For this demonstration, we'll use a combination of:\n",
    "- A small sample of scraped Stack Overflow data\n",
    "- Pre-existing coding datasets from Hugging Face\n",
    "- A pre-trained language model that already has coding knowledge"
   ]
